                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So it is a bad game? Kinda. Do I recommend it? No\n\nIt has a solid base to be an interesting game but the devs didn't push it past the base, the game becomes repetitive really quick without a clear objective other than just go from start to finish and kill anything in your way, is not difficult enough for a rougelike game, I managed to beat the whole game in one sitting, the bullet hell combined with badly placed enemies will make you get hit many many times without you realizing, that alone makes me not want to 100% this game considering it has hitless achievements.\n\nThis could have been a really great experience if they added a better variety on enemies, changing how they look is not enough, harder bosses, better enemy placement, properly made maps...\n\nIf you like bullet hells / shoot em ups and something to play in 2 hours, grab it on discount.",
